  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>16</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>I</mi></math> be the identity matrix of order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>. If <math><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is a matrix such that <math><msup><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
